// spec: a switch on a class takes its implicit conversion to an integer or an enum ([stmt.switch] 2, contextually implicitly converted: no explicit conversion operator); a class with only an explicit one is the checker's error at the condition (it was codegen's "does not support a switch on a class without a conversion ... yet")
